# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# New Creation Hubs — environment variables
# The landing page currently requires NO environment variables.
# Everything (3D scene, forms, sound) runs fully client-side.
# Placeholders below are only for future integrations — do NOT put
# real secrets in this file.
# -------------------------------------------------------------------

# Optional: absolute URL of the deployed site (SEO/social metadata)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-domain.netlify.app

# Optional: endpoint if you later replace the mailto contact flow
# with a real backend or Netlify Function
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://api.example.com/contact
